1671 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I produce events and run growth campaigns\056 My favourite part is turning \215we should do something\216 into an invitation worth opening\056 I started organising youth camps in Penang in high school\054 planned student events at RMIT in 2019 and went on to co\055produce Derive\220s Traders Breakfast in Bali\056 Today\054 I host regular Friends of Friends gatherings in Jakarta\056Interior design taught me to think past the guest list and notice how much the setting shapes what people do once they arrive\056 It\220s why I think about what happens after the event before I send the first invite\056)
