  << /ActualText (LEMON TREE TECHNOLOGY\nPartnerships \046 Growth\054 Part\055time \267 Remote \267 Apr 2026\205Present\nCo\055led outreach from first contact to close\054 securing partnerships with 10\053 decentralised exchanges\056\nResearched liquidity models and market structure to identify trading venues for partnership outreach\056\nBuilt the company\220s landing page and developed pitch decks and materials for prospective partners\056\n\nTAGO CAPITAL\nBusiness Development\054 Commission\055based \267 Remote \267 Apr 2026\205Present\nResearched and qualified prospects in AI\054 robotics and emerging technology for founder\055led outreach\056\nManaged first contact and follow\055up with qualified prospects through early commercial conversations\056\nWrote pitches explaining the company\220s technical services to founders and prospective buyers\056\n\nDERIVE\056XYZ\nGrowth Marketing \046 Community \267 Remote \267 Sep 2024\205Feb 2026\nCo\055produced Derive\220s Traders Breakfast at Coinfest Bali in 2025\054 managing trader outreach\054 guest approvals\054 check\055in and on\055site branding for a 30\055person loft\056 Delivered the event for under US\0442\054000\056\nGrew Derive\220s Discord from 15\054000 to 40\054000\053 members through its token launch\054 coordinating community communications across Discord\054 Telegram\054 and X\056\nLed community communications and design for the Lyra\055to\055Derive rebrand\054 keeping launch messaging consistent across channels\056\nBuilt and launched Derive\220s Framer landing page and designed marketing campaign assets\054 merchandise and partner materials\056\n\nMISURA\nSales \046 Design Consultant \267 Melbourne \267 Oct 2023\205Mar 2024\nManaged residential furniture sales from consultation through after\055sales\054 closing projects worth A\04425\054000 on average\056\nUsed 3D visualisation to guide clients through layouts\054 finishes and custom specifications across seven European furniture brands\056\nDesigned Melbourne showroom layouts to guide customer flow and showcase furniture from multiple brands\056\n\nBRUCE MEDIA\nSocial Media Intern \267 Melbourne \267 Jul 2023\205Dec 2023\nDesigned social content and wrote production briefs for accounts including IWC Schaffhausen\054 the AFL and Dandenong City SC\056\nSupported match\055day productions and interview shoots\054 capturing footage for sports and lifestyle accounts\056\nPublished live match\055day content under tight production deadlines\056\n)
